WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.573
Look at fifteen, nine and twenty. Which comes first when we order the numbers?

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.074
Increasing order is nine, fifteen, twenty.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.053
Decreasing order is twenty, fifteen, nine.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.831
Thirty four has three tens. Forty three has four tens. Thirty four is less than forty

00:00:18.831 --> 00:00:19.167
three.
